---
/**
 * The REPutation wordmark, with "REP" in the brand accent.
 *
 * The pun (reps → reputation) only lands if the "REP" reads as its own unit, so
 * it is coloured rather than left as plain text. `site.name` stays a plain string
 * everywhere text-only markup is required (title, OG, JSON-LD, alt text); this is
 * for the places that render the name as visible type.
 */
---

<span class="whitespace-nowrap"><span class="text-accent-bright">REP</span>utation</span>
